Hi {Owner},

I build websites for martial arts schools around {City}. {Business Name} has great belt test and class posts on its social pages, but no site where a parent can see the kids' schedule and book a trial class.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: kids' classes by age, a belt rank path, a trial class booking with a waiver and an after-school pickup section, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and schedule changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone before your afternoon classes?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
